WEBVTT

00:07.170 --> 00:08.460
H-Huh?

00:08.460 --> 00:09.860
Do you take sugar?

00:09.860 --> 00:11.570
Uh... yes...

00:11.570 --> 00:14.490
Wait, who <i>are</i> you?!

00:15.050 --> 00:18.250
And how is there coffee in this world?!

00:18.250 --> 00:22.640
I've been waiting for you to come
here, Cain von Silford-kun...

00:22.640 --> 00:25.830
Also known as... Shiina Kazuya.

00:28.540 --> 00:30.860
C'mon, no need to be so guarded.

00:31.350 --> 00:33.690
Old Zenom and the rest of
them told me about you.

00:34.130 --> 00:36.930
You reincarnated here, right?

00:36.930 --> 00:40.390
What? You've met with the gods?

00:40.390 --> 00:41.430
Sure.

00:41.930 --> 00:46.230
I'm Yuuya Terra Hirasawa Esfort, or just...

00:46.470 --> 00:48.440
Hirasawa Yuuya.

00:48.880 --> 00:52.110
What?! You mean you're the first king?!

00:52.110 --> 00:53.990
You know about that, huh?

00:54.110 --> 00:58.530
I read the book you wrote
about emperor-level magic!

00:58.530 --> 01:02.220
But... that was more than
300 years ago, wasn't it?

01:02.700 --> 01:05.330
Wait, are you... a ghost?!

01:06.810 --> 01:08.640
Just use Judgment and find out.

01:08.970 --> 01:10.320
Can I?

01:10.320 --> 01:11.190
Sure.

01:11.690 --> 01:13.720
Status... Open.

01:15.060 --> 01:17.380
<b>God of Creation</b>

01:15.060 --> 01:17.380
What?! God of Creation?!

01:18.000 --> 01:21.460
This world is called Fabneil,
and I created it.

01:21.460 --> 01:23.290
Which makes me its God of Creation...

01:23.290 --> 01:25.770
And even after 300 years,
I still look like this!

01:26.000 --> 01:27.100
Huh?!

01:27.370 --> 01:29.020
What?!

01:30.480 --> 01:32.540
<i>I thought of myself as a</i>

01:32.540 --> 01:36.610
<i>reincarnated noble who just couldn't
help being off-the-charts...</i>

01:37.890 --> 01:42.920
<i>But maybe my "charts" really
hadn't seen anything yet.</i>

01:54.170 --> 01:57.050
The Aristocrat's
<b>Otherworldly Adventure:
Serving Gods Who Go Too Far</b>

03:14.480 --> 03:18.730
"Training"

03:14.480 --> 03:18.730
"Training"

03:15.280 --> 03:17.110
Anyway, have a seat.

03:17.630 --> 03:20.180
Let's talk about why 
I asked you to come here.

03:20.930 --> 03:22.050
The truth is...

03:23.240 --> 03:26.690
Old Zenom and the rest of
them asked me to train you.

03:26.690 --> 03:31.210
Why? I'm already having a hard
enough time because I'm too strong.

03:31.210 --> 03:32.390
Okay...

03:32.650 --> 03:34.860
Can you take this cookie from me, then?

03:38.360 --> 03:39.770
You've got a long way to go.

03:40.170 --> 03:44.600
Yuuya-san, why do I need to be that strong?

03:44.970 --> 03:47.590
Because there's someone

03:48.520 --> 03:51.040
that you need to fight.

03:52.220 --> 03:54.690
Someone I need to fight?

03:54.690 --> 03:55.670
Yes.

03:55.930 --> 04:00.920
Someone who, 300 years ago, made people all
over the world fight and kill each other.

04:01.400 --> 04:04.100
Wait a minute... How could anyone...

04:04.100 --> 04:05.090
Simple.

04:05.440 --> 04:06.940
He used an oracle

04:07.320 --> 04:10.250
to sow distrust of other countries
in everyone's subconsciousness,

04:10.250 --> 04:11.270
forcing them to fight.

04:11.980 --> 04:14.060
The one you need to fight...

04:14.670 --> 04:16.310
is the evil god, Aaron.

04:16.590 --> 04:21.010
My companions and I managed
to seal him 300 years ago,

04:21.990 --> 04:25.640
but recently, that seal
has started to loosen.

04:26.460 --> 04:28.960
If nothing is done,
Aaron will be resurrected.

04:29.520 --> 04:33.130
Can't you just seal him again?

04:34.190 --> 04:35.250
Nope.

04:35.250 --> 04:38.290
I'm a god of this world now.

04:38.970 --> 04:43.370
Just like all those old farts,
I can't interfere in that world.

04:43.370 --> 04:44.130
What?!

04:44.390 --> 04:46.240
So you're saying...

04:46.240 --> 04:47.340
Precisely!

04:47.560 --> 04:49.090
It's all up to you!

04:49.400 --> 04:51.060
I knew it!

04:51.330 --> 04:56.020
I'll also let you know that your
previous life comes in to play here.

04:56.410 --> 04:57.590
It does?

04:58.250 --> 05:00.400
What do you mean by that?!

05:02.550 --> 05:04.170
The ocean?!

05:04.170 --> 05:07.070
Here. From this point on, I'm your teacher.

05:07.690 --> 05:10.630
Once you're able to complete
this task, I'll tell you more.

05:11.270 --> 05:12.040
Move!

05:13.190 --> 05:16.130
Wait a minute! Please, tell me now!

05:16.130 --> 05:18.790
What do you mean,
my previous life comes into play?!

05:19.200 --> 05:20.250
If you want to know,

05:20.500 --> 05:23.090
just keep moving in the
direction this indicates.

05:23.370 --> 05:25.920
It will lead you to the
mansion where we just were!

05:26.380 --> 05:28.260
Start by raising your level.

05:28.880 --> 05:31.100
In this world's terms,
you're around lower-middle level.

05:31.480 --> 05:34.640
You need to be level 600, at the very least,
 to stand a chance against Aaron.

05:35.470 --> 05:37.130
I'm at 300 now...

05:35.520 --> 05:36.730
<b>Currently</b>

05:37.130 --> 05:39.970
Oh, I'm sure it'll take some time,

05:39.970 --> 05:41.820
but no using Move, all right?

05:41.820 --> 05:45.560
Wait, if it's gonna take that long, 
what about school?

05:45.560 --> 05:49.880
Don't worry. One year here
is equal to one day there.

05:50.300 --> 05:54.070
Well, later. Get back soon
and have tea with me.

05:54.070 --> 05:55.020
Move!

05:55.020 --> 05:56.200
Teacher!

05:56.200 --> 05:57.830
Wait a minute, please!

05:57.830 --> 05:58.710
Cain...

05:59.050 --> 06:02.010
Either you do it... or you don't.

06:04.370 --> 06:07.050
So I have no choice but to do this?

06:18.520 --> 06:22.200
<i>It's only been five minutes since
I walked into the forest...</i>

06:25.110 --> 06:28.850
Fine, I'll do it!
Leveling up is what an otaku does best!

06:28.850 --> 06:30.530
Let's do this!

06:32.890 --> 06:33.890
Master Cain!

06:33.890 --> 06:35.170
Have you returned—

06:36.870 --> 06:39.210
Princess Teles... Miss Silk...

06:39.880 --> 06:41.630
Please forgive me.

06:41.630 --> 06:45.710
I heard a sound and thought
it was Master Cain returning.

06:46.030 --> 06:47.920
Then, Cain hasn't returned yet?

06:48.160 --> 06:51.390
No. He hasn't been back since yesterday.

06:51.610 --> 06:55.860
Oh, no! Since he wasn't at school,
we thought he'd be here!

06:55.860 --> 06:59.860
Do you think he could've been
caught up in some incident?!

06:59.860 --> 07:01.400
Like a kidnapping...

07:01.400 --> 07:02.690
Or imprisonment...

07:03.100 --> 07:04.680
Or he's stuck in a ditch?!

07:05.400 --> 07:06.370
He's fine.

07:06.370 --> 07:07.440
How do you know?

07:07.880 --> 07:09.910
Because he's Master Cain.

07:10.330 --> 07:13.690
If we just wait here, he'll come home.

07:14.260 --> 07:15.500
Pardon me.

07:17.540 --> 07:18.870
<i>I might never make it back...</i>

07:24.900 --> 07:28.260
<i>I'm never going to get
out of this forest, am I?</i>

07:29.050 --> 07:31.790
<i>I haven't gotten enough sleep in months.</i>

07:33.030 --> 07:37.340
<i>I don't have the will to think
about anything anymore...</i>

07:37.340 --> 07:39.620
<i>Not even myself.</i>

07:41.740 --> 07:44.330
<i>What now? I can't deal with this...</i>

07:46.650 --> 07:47.660
<i>Who's there?</i>

07:48.530 --> 07:53.210
<i>Was it instinct that sent me
walking in response to that call,</i>

07:53.210 --> 07:55.320
<i>or was I just not conscious of it?</i>

08:04.130 --> 08:05.960
<i>It's hurt badly.</i>

08:07.360 --> 08:10.250
<i>I'll put you out of your misery now.</i>

08:27.290 --> 08:30.390
I'm sorry I scared you...

08:32.090 --> 08:37.020
I always... just wanted to protect someone...

08:41.140 --> 08:42.830
Extra Heal.

08:44.380 --> 08:47.540
If I'm low on magic,
I just need to force it out!

08:48.170 --> 08:50.400
Extra Heal!

09:12.170 --> 09:14.900
Wait, were you actually...

09:15.460 --> 09:17.610
protecting me?

09:23.940 --> 09:25.100
Cut that out.

09:27.130 --> 09:30.090
Are you all alone?

09:32.290 --> 09:35.740
I see. I'm all alone, too.

09:36.410 --> 09:39.300
Hey, in that case, want to come with me?

09:43.770 --> 09:45.800
With me...

09:47.690 --> 09:49.370
Come, Haku!

09:50.030 --> 09:54.300
<i>Thanks to Haku, I regained
something very important.</i>

09:54.690 --> 09:57.150
<i>No matter how tough things get,
I can't give in!</i>

09:57.620 --> 09:58.360
<i>I have...</i>

09:59.120 --> 10:00.820
<i>something I need to protect!</i>

10:07.010 --> 10:08.040
He's here?

10:09.150 --> 10:10.160
Welcome back.

10:11.590 --> 10:13.190
You sure got bigger.

10:14.250 --> 10:16.130
Of course I did, Teacher.

10:16.610 --> 10:19.720
How many years do you think it's been?

10:20.100 --> 10:21.730
About four?

10:22.540 --> 10:25.070
Oh, is that a fenrir?

10:25.070 --> 10:26.190
This is Haku.

10:26.190 --> 10:30.730
Uh, no. That's a fenrir, a holy beast.

10:30.730 --> 10:33.560
Haku, you're that special?

10:34.680 --> 10:35.810
Wow...

10:35.810 --> 10:39.680
If he trusts you that much,
he might form a contract with you.

10:39.680 --> 10:40.900
A contract?

10:40.900 --> 10:45.090
If you use Contract Summon,
you can call him to you at any time.

10:45.090 --> 10:46.060
Ready?

10:47.720 --> 10:49.030
He disappeared!

10:49.030 --> 10:51.280
You can call him back at any
time by saying "Summon Haku."

10:51.690 --> 10:54.460
And your training isn't over yet.

10:54.910 --> 10:57.050
You'll be practicing under this guy next.

10:57.620 --> 11:00.590
This is your new teacher, Derain.

11:01.130 --> 11:03.920
I'm Cain. It's a pleasure to meet you.

11:04.460 --> 11:07.930
But first... you made a promise to me.

11:07.930 --> 11:09.980
Please tell me now, Teacher...

11:10.220 --> 11:14.310
About Aaron, and about my previous life.

11:14.650 --> 11:18.030
That's true. All right, let's talk...

11:18.290 --> 11:20.750
before you leave.

11:21.550 --> 11:22.270
Yes.

11:29.580 --> 11:32.080
As of now, you're not strong enough.

11:32.080 --> 11:33.830
Yuuya is stronger than me,

11:33.830 --> 11:35.670
and he is stronger than Yuuya.

11:35.980 --> 11:37.250
Which means...

11:37.470 --> 11:38.950
Boost!

11:48.940 --> 11:51.390
I don't know that ceiling...

11:53.290 --> 11:55.400
Hey, you're heavy.

11:55.400 --> 11:57.610
Oh, you're awake?

11:57.610 --> 11:59.290
Did you sleep well?

11:59.290 --> 12:00.230
Yes...

12:00.230 --> 12:01.690
Glad to hear it!

12:01.690 --> 12:02.830
Um...

12:02.830 --> 12:06.390
Oh, me? I'm Derain's wife, Ruri.

12:06.390 --> 12:07.530
And this is...

12:07.530 --> 12:09.360
our house.

12:09.360 --> 12:13.370
I was so surprised when Derain
carried you here yesterday.

12:13.910 --> 12:16.300
Wait just a bit. I'll have
some food ready soon.

12:18.300 --> 12:20.410
A baby dragon!

12:24.180 --> 12:26.890
I'm Cain! Let's be friends!

12:32.590 --> 12:35.040
Hang on! No fighting!

12:35.610 --> 12:37.230
He hates me now...

12:37.230 --> 12:40.860
Now, you two! Stop that at once!

12:40.860 --> 12:41.560
Or...

12:41.560 --> 12:42.650
No food for you!

12:44.150 --> 12:45.290
Wow!

12:45.290 --> 12:46.490
Dig in.

12:46.800 --> 12:48.520
I will, thank you!

12:51.150 --> 12:53.410
What's wrong? Don't like it?

12:53.770 --> 12:55.770
No, it's delicious!

12:55.770 --> 12:59.190
It's been forever since
I ate anything this good!

13:00.500 --> 13:04.450
Come to think of it, Yuuya said you were
on your own in the wilderness for four years.

13:04.450 --> 13:05.220
Yes!

13:05.220 --> 13:09.440
It's seriously been so long
since I had food this delicious!

13:09.440 --> 13:11.680
Okay, then! Eat your fill!

13:11.680 --> 13:15.060
You'll be living here from now on,
 so I'll be making more!

13:15.060 --> 13:17.070
Thank you so much!

13:17.470 --> 13:21.730
Being treated this well reminds
me of being back home!

13:22.180 --> 13:25.320
I hope they're all eating
delicious food, too!

13:29.290 --> 13:32.640
It's all right. The knights
are searching for him.

13:33.340 --> 13:38.470
We should just do what we 
can while we wait for him.

13:38.470 --> 13:42.340
You're right. We want him to
be happy when he comes home.

13:42.340 --> 13:44.260
Hey! Your hands aren't moving!

13:45.220 --> 13:47.470
The road to cooking mastery
is long and steep!

13:47.470 --> 13:49.430
The road to dessert mastery
requires heavy labor!

13:49.860 --> 13:54.170
You'll never make anything that'll
make Master Cain happy that way!

13:54.170 --> 13:57.230
Yes, ma'am! Thank you for your guidance!

13:58.290 --> 13:59.390
Not good enough!

13:59.390 --> 14:00.270
Yes, sir!

14:03.650 --> 14:05.190
You withstood that, eh?

14:06.780 --> 14:08.250
He's doing well.

14:08.610 --> 14:10.240
When we first started his training...

14:10.240 --> 14:11.320
Welcome back!

14:11.320 --> 14:13.080
He couldn't even make it back home.

14:14.580 --> 14:15.840
Curious?

14:16.850 --> 14:18.370
<b>Then, One Year Later</b>

14:23.610 --> 14:25.590
Get up! Are you done already?!

14:26.120 --> 14:29.340
Yuuya is stronger than me, and Aaron—

14:29.800 --> 14:33.310
But first... you made a promise to me.

14:33.310 --> 14:35.020
Please tell me now, Teacher...

14:35.250 --> 14:39.040
About Aaron, and about my previous life.

14:39.730 --> 14:42.880
That's true. All right, let's talk...

14:43.370 --> 14:46.070
before you leave.

14:46.600 --> 14:51.380
Aaron used to be the 
God of Amusement in Old Zenom's world.

14:52.510 --> 14:54.160
The God of Amusement?

14:54.380 --> 14:56.490
You mean there was an eighth god?

14:56.890 --> 15:00.980
Yep. There are no games or
entertainment in your world, right?

15:01.290 --> 15:03.660
That's because the God of Amusement is gone.

15:05.790 --> 15:08.130
Aaron used an oracle

15:08.130 --> 15:12.670
to make innocent people all over the
world participate in a death game.

15:13.440 --> 15:16.900
He was banished from the realm
of the gods as a result.

15:17.810 --> 15:21.200
But if he comes back,
the death game will happen again,

15:21.600 --> 15:24.610
and everyone precious to you
will be caught up in it.

15:25.320 --> 15:27.310
I don't want that!

15:27.310 --> 15:29.810
Teacher, how can I stop Aaron?

15:29.810 --> 15:30.990
Get stronger.

15:31.350 --> 15:35.080
Gain more power so you can
protect those you care about.

15:39.820 --> 15:42.170
Cain, there's something I want to tell you.

15:43.480 --> 15:46.430
I was unable to protect my friends.

15:47.170 --> 15:51.670
Remember when I told you 
Aaron was linked to Shiina Kazuya?

15:53.160 --> 15:55.940
The friends I failed to protect...

15:56.690 --> 15:59.810
were your parents.

15:57.640 --> 15:59.810
Shiina Megumi
Lies Here

15:57.640 --> 15:59.810
Shiina Seiya
Lies Here

15:59.890 --> 16:00.750
What?!

16:01.720 --> 16:03.300
What's going to happen to Kazuya?

16:03.660 --> 16:05.980
If we're dead...

16:06.200 --> 16:08.820
You said your name's Marine?
You're the one who called us here?

16:09.160 --> 16:13.280
Yes, Yuuya... Seiya... Megumi.

16:13.910 --> 16:16.490
Please allow me to explain our situation.

16:19.210 --> 16:22.290
Marine-san, are you sure about this?

16:22.290 --> 16:25.770
If they find out you let us go, you'll be...

16:26.410 --> 16:27.600
It's all right.

16:27.940 --> 16:31.840
Either way, I can't go along
with the pontiff's ideas.

16:32.390 --> 16:33.300
More importantly...

16:33.800 --> 16:37.690
Please go and see the changes happening
to this world with your own eyes.

16:40.100 --> 16:44.830
That is Aaron, the cause of the
changes you're investigating.

16:45.270 --> 16:48.820
But the seven of us are unable
to directly interfere.

16:49.430 --> 16:51.790
Summoned heroes, I beg of you...

16:52.200 --> 16:55.630
Bring calm to this world.

16:58.410 --> 17:00.050
Inferno!

17:03.080 --> 17:04.940
Inferno isn't working!

17:04.940 --> 17:05.790
It can't be!

17:14.220 --> 17:15.100
We can do it!

17:15.100 --> 17:15.890
We've got this!

17:15.890 --> 17:19.260
You detestable humans!

17:26.580 --> 17:28.270
Megumi!

17:30.970 --> 17:32.860
Megumi! Megumi!

17:33.910 --> 17:36.450
No! My healing magic isn't enough!

17:38.060 --> 17:38.780
Aaron!

17:39.230 --> 17:41.930
You... You won't get away with this!

17:41.930 --> 17:44.120
Overload!

17:44.120 --> 17:45.120
What?!

17:45.420 --> 17:46.950
Yuuya!

17:47.920 --> 17:49.710
Now! The stone!

17:50.180 --> 17:52.960
No, Dad! Get away!

17:52.960 --> 17:54.090
Seal!

17:58.120 --> 17:59.550
Kazuya...

17:59.550 --> 18:02.810
Kazuya... I'm sorry...

18:05.830 --> 18:07.890
I... I want...

18:07.890 --> 18:10.230
to protect the people I care about!

18:10.720 --> 18:13.860
I want to help people who are in trouble!

18:13.860 --> 18:15.820
Overload!

18:23.030 --> 18:24.950
This ends it.

18:27.520 --> 18:28.880
I lose.

18:29.590 --> 18:31.420
That does it for your training.

18:33.330 --> 18:35.000
Thank you for everything.

18:36.130 --> 18:38.520
Mom! Dad!

18:42.540 --> 18:45.630
So this is where they went.

18:46.660 --> 18:50.280
They were always worrying about you.

18:51.160 --> 18:53.500
Even as we prepared for the
final battle against Aaron,

18:54.340 --> 18:57.680
they were still searching for a way
to get back to their own world.

18:58.650 --> 19:00.410
So that's what happened...

19:00.790 --> 19:03.030
Mom... Dad...

19:03.470 --> 19:06.530
Thank you for always thinking of me.

19:10.300 --> 19:15.090
And thank you for looking after my parents.

19:15.090 --> 19:17.370
You did so much for both of them.

19:18.490 --> 19:22.270
Thanks, Kazuya... no, Cain.

19:31.820 --> 19:33.280
You've gotten stronger.

19:33.760 --> 19:36.520
All thanks to your training.

19:37.680 --> 19:39.650
I didn't do anything.

19:40.710 --> 19:42.480
You're the one who worked hard.

19:43.880 --> 19:47.330
Well, why don't we head back
and have some good coffee?

19:47.330 --> 19:51.370
No, I need to hurry back to my own world.

19:51.690 --> 19:52.520
Ah, right.

19:53.460 --> 19:54.280
Goodbye!

19:54.280 --> 19:56.360
Hey, wait up, Cain!

19:56.360 --> 19:58.420
You've been here for five years.

19:59.120 --> 20:00.880
You're gonna go back looking like that?

20:04.640 --> 20:05.890
Teacher?

20:06.270 --> 20:07.710
Take Haku with you.

20:07.710 --> 20:09.050
Summon Haku!

20:09.770 --> 20:14.150
Would you take our little one
out to see that big world, too?

20:14.150 --> 20:15.610
Teacher Derain!

20:15.920 --> 20:17.130
Contract!

20:17.130 --> 20:18.860
Summon Gin!

20:19.570 --> 20:20.680
Teacher Derain.

20:21.260 --> 20:22.530
Teacher Yuuya.

20:23.130 --> 20:25.800
Thank you for looking after me for so long.

20:26.260 --> 20:27.490
Come visit us sometime.

20:28.090 --> 20:28.950
I will!

20:29.370 --> 20:30.300
Goodbye!

20:30.300 --> 20:31.340
Whoa!

20:31.340 --> 20:33.220
Give this to the current king for me!

20:35.690 --> 20:37.540
He sure was a lively one.

20:37.540 --> 20:41.040
I think he'll grow even
stronger than you and me.

20:42.570 --> 20:44.090
Of course he will.

20:44.900 --> 20:49.180
He has something much greater
to protect than we do.

20:50.510 --> 20:51.310
And...

20:51.970 --> 20:54.180
he's protected by lots of people himself.

20:57.150 --> 20:58.610
Master Cain!

21:00.340 --> 21:01.950
Master Cain!

21:01.950 --> 21:04.240
Master Cain!

21:01.950 --> 21:04.240
Cain!

21:04.540 --> 21:07.160
Sylvia... Sorry I worried you.

21:07.490 --> 21:09.450
Teles and Silk, too.

21:09.450 --> 21:15.540
We had faith that you would come back. So...

21:15.540 --> 21:18.380
While we waited, we had Sylvia teach us...

21:19.110 --> 21:20.960
to make these cookies.

21:22.740 --> 21:25.170
She said you liked them.

21:27.550 --> 21:30.230
They're so good! Teles! Silk!

21:30.230 --> 21:32.710
You like cookies that much, Cain?

21:32.710 --> 21:33.330
Yes!

21:33.330 --> 21:35.950
They're good! So good!

21:38.310 --> 21:39.610
Master Cain!

21:38.310 --> 21:39.610
Cain!

21:41.030 --> 21:42.180
Welcome home!

21:42.620 --> 21:44.110
Welcome home!

21:45.910 --> 21:47.060
Thanks.

21:50.010 --> 21:51.890
Welcome home!

23:26.280 --> 23:27.760
On your heels!

23:28.200 --> 23:29.670
Sit on your heels right there!

23:30.270 --> 23:32.160
I-I thought so...

23:34.950 --> 23:36.430
<b>Preview</b>

23:35.450 --> 23:36.430
Next time—

23:36.780 --> 23:40.250
<b>"The Trials of an A-Rank Adventurer"</b>

23:37.480 --> 23:39.890
They can't hear what I'm saying
with you two doing this!
